     2	
     3	**Status:** evidence drafted 2026-10-27 for the 20 Nov obligation, revised the same day for Codex review P3R-01..06
     4	(`docs/reviews/p3-profile/CODEX-REVIEW.md`). It is not a tracker move. `formal/PROPERTIES.md` row P3 stays `checked`
     5	until the owner assesses this evidence and the author rules on the translation (§4). The review verdict was
