   103	## A11.4 Dependency duty for registered decisions
   104	
   105	When a registered decision changes a parameter (an algorithm, a custody form, a channel, a horizon, a scope, a key),
   106	the owner sweeps the registered texts for sentences whose referent the change alters. Each one is recorded as
   107	amended, superseded, still fitting or open, before the decision's change is treated as complete. An owner decision
   108	that touches a registered parameter is checked against those texts before it is recorded.
